  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/graph2/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e. WI-dibuf (d3bbf8bdcf, 2026-10-31) added *Test/*Tests/*IT for .java/.kt/.scala and *Tests.swift. Live probe now True: src/com/x/FooTest.java, FooTests/FooTests.swift, src/FooIT.java, androidTest/.../FooTest.kt (by its name only). Still False: MyApp.Tests/FooTests.cs, MyApp.UnitTests/FooTests.cs, src/FooTests.cs, src/FooSpec.scala, src/FooSpec.kt, androidTest/java/Helper.kt, src/FooTest.groovy. sketch.TEST_FILE_PATTERNS is now defined but never referenced (dead data); supply_chain keeps its own TEST_FILE_PATTERNS. MECHANISM: paths.classify_test_file has no rule for .cs suffixes, dotted .NET test-project dirs, androidTest/ or the Spec suffix. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: none."  # a583
